Hey there

I am using a rather old AlphaBios, so this might be out of date. If not,
read this:

To get more than three OS selection entries in AlphaBios, do the
following:


- Be sure you already have three entries
- Boot NT, put in the NT CD and select Upgrade NT installation.

---> Warning! Be sure to have a backup copy of the running NT, as this
might mess up your installation. Well, for Linux users, this is not that
big a deal :) Guess we're just lucky!

- After the installation process reboots, press F2, and you got a forth
entry in the OS selection menu.


Wow, that was easy, no?

Have fun, Tobe

P.S. be sure to get rid of NT afterwards ;)



