You need 3 disks for Multia's

    1)  MSDOS Format Disk with:
                linload.exe
                milo                        from the milo/noname dir

    2) RAWRITE a disk with:
                noname.gz

    3) RAWRITE a disk with:
                ramdisk.img

   Use the ARC firmware to load milo per the MILO mini-howto
and use the first disk with the command:

        boot fd0:/vmlinux.gz root=/dev/fd0 load_ramdisk=1


