Check setserial manpage. Set the speed to 38400 and use the spd_vhi
switch. 
This effectively does 115200 B/s.

In my /etc/rc.d, in rc.local, I set:

# Allow 115200 Baud on the /dev/modem although only 38400 is specified
#
setserial /dev/modem spd_vhi
#

I guess this helps you too.

Peter




