this NT somwehow in the first place so maybe this firmware is
different?).

NT on Jensen has to be a sorry sight ("i strashno, i smeshno" if you
know some Russian :-).  No wonder that this box gathers dust.
Getting it to run under Linux can be an excercise in ingenuity.
