2.0.36 is the lastes stable release, 2.1.132 the latest beta and
2.2.0-pre7[1] the latest alpha(read: development) kernel. people usually
suggest to stick with stable kernels, but i'd recommend testing 2.1.132
or even 2.2.0-preX, since they're much more alpha aware (the 2.0.x kernels
need patches for alpha IIRC, the 2.1.xx and 2.2.0-preX have it built in).

