Jeff Stoner wrote:
> 
> I appreciate any suggestions on how to get this working. Thanks!

If your monitor truly is a multisync monitor with standard
compact db15 connector, etc., the card should be able to
generate a signal that the monitor can sync.  One thing to look
for is sync-on-green generation.  In your case, you shouldn't
need it and you'll want to disable it at the srm console.
Environment variable should be something like 'tga_sync_on_green'
but I'm working from memory here.  Set it to zero, reinit,
and boot.

